  "title": "Thai Style Shrimp",
  "description": "A dish made in half an hour! Plump shrimp are sauteed quickly and then simmered in coconut milk infused with garlic and ginger. Serve with white rice and steamed broccoli for a luscious quick dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Colleen Moir"
